  "description": "The text 'admins be like' is positioned above the crying baby, creating an analogical mapping where the baby's distressed state is used to represent the exaggerated emotional state of administrators when dealing with their groups. The baby's crying is mapped onto the perceived frustration or exasperation of admins, humorously suggesting that admins react with infantile distress to group management challenges.",
